FF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-ho/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Checklist stages in the bob-cli evaluator, CLI, and contract[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]walk_order[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]walk_order: parse and validate freshness.pre_stages/post_stages, resolve[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]each PRE/POST row's stage, sort PRE/POST by stage rank then path and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]line, add three lints, schema-16 JSON, the human stage detail, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared CS/SC fixture, and the freshness contract and guide docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Relative period ids (last-week, last-quarter, last-year) in [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]bob periods[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]period_ids[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]period_ids: accept last-week, last-quarter, and last-year wherever bob [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]periods show, brief, and draft take a PERIOD, resolved against today, so[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the launch rows can carry one paste-ready agent prompt forever.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Checklist stages in bob-ledger-tools (JS mirror, namespace [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]v14, footer)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]ledger_order[dim] · [dim][/dim]after walk_order[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ledger_order: mirror the stage config, resolver, and comparator in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]JS evaluator against a byte-for-byte copy of the shared fixture, expose [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stage fields under freshness namespace v14 checklistStages, and show the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stage in the review footer and landing toasts.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stage labels beside the sunrise and flag in the editor[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]stage_labels[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ledger_order[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]stage_labels: specify and render a quiet small-caps stage label right [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]after the PRE sunrise / POST flag in Live Preview and Reading view, only[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]for a configured stage tag adjacent to the identity run, with tooltip, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reveal, toggle, and light/dark checks.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stage-end ticks and staged-advance regression tests in [/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]navigation[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]nav_ticks[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ledger_order[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]nav_ticks: add the quiet STAGE ✓ tick to Ctrl+Enter done lines when a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stage's last due row is completed, and lock in queue-order advance when [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the next staged row sits above the cursor.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Config, vault rows, end-to-end verification, and the decision [bold black on #87D7FF][/bold #D7AFFF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]record[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]rollout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after walk_order, period_ids, ledger_order, stage_labels, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]nav_ticks[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]rollout: add the stage lists to the chezmoi-managed bob config, tag the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]existing gtd_daily rows, add the three launch rows, reword the review [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rows, verify the Monday walk, and write the accepted memory records.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-ho","llm_provider":"mu